<h1 class="photo-story-title">
  Workshirts
</h1>

<div style="font-size: 12px; padding: 30px 20px 100px 20px; max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 18px;">
  The workshirt is a seasonal staple here at Adsum. The versatility of it makes for a nice transition out of the spring chill, and into the warmer summer months ahead.
  <br/><br/>
  This season, we decided to make our workshirt in three fabrics—a light yarn dyed beige brushed flannel with a soft hand feel, an unbrushed burnt umber vertical stripe broken twill, as well as a Japanese yarn dyed indigo plaid. All three fabrics are unique in their specific look and feel, but ultimately accomplish the same goal; looking good throughout the changing seasons.
  <br/><br/>
  All our workshirts are made & tested here in NYC and constructed using a classic double needle chain stitch for added durability.
</div>


